<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Hoogovens.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Hoogovens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoogovens was rated &quot;buy&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>CSFB analyst Jeremy Fletcher set a price target of 115 guilders on the stock, saying that gave 24 percent upside.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
